{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Infinity Rage</strong> \u2013 The hellish pinball-brickbreaking arcade nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infinity Rage</strong> is a unique blend of classic pinball and the legendary Breakout game. You\u2019re hitting the ball with flippers, breaking bricks \u2014 but there\u2019s a twist:<br>\ud83d\udc49 <strong>you have infinite balls, but one mistake resets everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple:<br>\ud83c\udfaf Collect <strong>all 45 badges</strong>\u00a0\u2014 if you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No hole to lose your ball</strong> \u2014 instead, a deadly spike awaits. Hit it and your score resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Timed gameplay</strong> \u2014 your final score depends on how fast and smart you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>45 unique badges</strong> \u2014 complete challenges and unlock all levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>12 distinct themes</strong> \u2014 switch anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sarcastic commentary</strong> \u2014 the game mocks you loudly every time you fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online leaderboard</strong> \u2014 prove your skill to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own themes</strong> \u2014 customize visuals, music, SFX, and even the demon\u2019s voice lines.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 Make your own levels and become part of the game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love creativity, design your own graphics and sounds!<br>Templates are available in the themes/#level_tools folder, and you can add custom voice lines in the say folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send us your creations \u2014 the best ones might be featured in the game or on the website!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infinity Rage</strong> is about endless retries, fast restarts, and testing your patience.<br>If you\u2019re persistent enough, you might conquer the ultimate challenge \u2014 or just enjoy laughing along with the game as it mocks you.<br><br>---\u00a0Controls and Sensors Overview ---<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907020/extras/766370a6b5921e6d57a094d8315d60c9.avif?t=1754372780\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907020?t=1754372780","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907020/c1c068b7ef1abad7c4399127d8b06b95e5df433e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754372780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907020/7d5d4c433ed2665c8132a6c0dcea07e5a0291042/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754372780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907020/7d5d4c433ed2665c8132a6c0dcea07e5a0291042/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754372780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Infinity Rage</strong> \u2013 The hellish pinball-brickbreaking arcade nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infinity Rage</strong> is a unique blend of classic pinball and the legendary Breakout game. You\u2019re hitting the ball with flippers, breaking bricks \u2014 but there\u2019s a twist:<br>\ud83d\udc49 <strong>you have infinite balls, but one mistake resets everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is simple:<br>\ud83c\udfaf Collect <strong>all 45 badges</strong>\u00a0\u2014 if you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25